-- REMOVE DEFAULT on an EPHEMERAL column
Cannot remove DEFAULT from column `value`, because column default type is EPHEMERAL. EPHEMERAL is not removable as a property: use DROP COLUMN `value` to delete the column, or MODIFY COLUMN to replace it with a DEFAULT, MATERIALIZED or ALIAS expression
names REMOVE EPHEMERAL: 0
-- REMOVE MATERIALIZED on an EPHEMERAL column
Cannot remove MATERIALIZED from column `value`, because column default type is EPHEMERAL. EPHEMERAL is not removable as a property: use DROP COLUMN `value` to delete the column, or MODIFY COLUMN to replace it with a DEFAULT, MATERIALIZED or ALIAS expression
names REMOVE EPHEMERAL: 0
-- REMOVE ALIAS on an EPHEMERAL column
Cannot remove ALIAS from column `value`, because column default type is EPHEMERAL. EPHEMERAL is not removable as a property: use DROP COLUMN `value` to delete the column, or MODIFY COLUMN to replace it with a DEFAULT, MATERIALIZED or ALIAS expression
names REMOVE EPHEMERAL: 0
-- DROP COLUMN on an EPHEMERAL column, then columns left named value
0
-- MODIFY COLUMN replacing EPHEMERAL with DEFAULT, then its default_kind
DEFAULT
-- MODIFY COLUMN replacing EPHEMERAL with MATERIALIZED, then its default_kind
MATERIALIZED
-- MODIFY COLUMN replacing EPHEMERAL with ALIAS, then its default_kind
ALIAS
-- the three kinds REMOVE accepts keep their advice
Use REMOVE DEFAULT to delete it
Use REMOVE MATERIALIZED to delete it
Use REMOVE ALIAS to delete it
